Name:Rules pilot 525 - Phage must be cast
Goal:Win
Turns:1
Difficulty:Easy
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Sneak Attack ({R}: put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield; it gains haste; sacrifice it at the next end step) and have Phage the Untouchable and Hill Giant in hand, with one red mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-put-not-cast-phage | Putting a creature onto the battlefield is not casting it (CR 601.1a, 603.4): Phage's enters trigger makes you lose the game if you didn't cast it from your hand, so Sneak Attack the Hill Giant and attack for 3 instead
